			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 700960101,
					"content": "...If you wanna know who's the strongest warrior, haha, look no further than our captain! He can hold back the Abyss with pure physical power alone!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Slazhnev"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960102,
					"content": "Ha! Exactly the sort of drivel I'd expect from someone who's never seen real combat! D'you think powerful warriors just stand around hitting wooden dummies? Besides, even if we're talking raw strength, I doubt he's a match for our Grand Master...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leifhelm"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960103,
					"content": "Ugh, that's enough! I didn't invite you both here to listen to you bicker.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960104,
					"content": "...Lohen? And isn't that...Leifhelm and Slazhnev? What are you guys doing together, and what brings you two all this way from Nod-Krai?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960105,
					"content": "Hah... I heard there were a couple of \"combatologists\" in Nod-Krai, so I invited them over to help me compile a \"Formidable Foes Fieldbook\".",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960106,
					"content": "If only I'd known combatologists were so darn combative... *sigh* Guess I'm gonna have to knock their heads together and see if I can't get them to be a bit more professional.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960107,
					"content": "Ahaha... I—I'll start drawing up a list right away! Ehehe...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Slazhnev"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960108,
					"content": "C—Captain Lohen! I'm not trying to be uncooperative, it's just that the word \"formidable\" is far too vague.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leifhelm"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960109,
					"content": "Never mind regular monsters — even the power gap between the Archons is huge. If we don't find a suitable benchmark, I'm afraid any further discussion will be pointless...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leifhelm"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960110,
					"content": "If we're talking about a benchmark of power that everyone can accept... we should probably go with dragons, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Slazhnev"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960111,
					"content": "...Dragons?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960112,
					"content": "Seriously? Paimon feels like the power gaps between dragons aren't much smaller than those between the Archons...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960113,
						700960114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960113,
					"content": "Why do you want to compile a Formidable Foes Fieldbook, anyway?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960115,
					"content": "Well... Long story short, after a period of reflection, I concluded that the best way to get even stronger was to challenge the most powerful opponents from all over the world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960116,
					"content": "(...Isn't that what you were already doing before?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960117,
					"content": "But then earlier this morning, just as I was about to set off... this weird-looking thing appeared in front of me and started talking a bunch of nonsense.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960118,
					"content": "\"Lost human, thrice shall you face the might of the dragon. Then, and only then, will you comprehend the true meaning of strength.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960119,
					"content": "(That sounds like something Barbeloth would say...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960120,
					"content": "I'm not one for believing in prophecies, but... Hmph, well let's just say that I feel like I'm being played here, and I don't like it one bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960121,
					"content": "Dragons, huh... Here in Mondstadt, you'd have to be talking about Dvalin or Ursa the Drake, or else those legends about Dragonspine... Hmm, what else is there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leifhelm"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960122,
					"content": "Hah, well clearly that's where your knowledge falls short! According to top-secret intel I acquired in Nod-Krai, a powerful ancient dragon has recently snuck into Dornman Port!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Slazhnev"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960123,
					"content": "Seriously!? No way...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960124,
					"content": "If we want the truth, there's only one way to find out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960114,
					"content": "Sure sounds like \"dragons\" got your attention…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960115
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7009602,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
