				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 700960601,
					"content": "Wonderful... Now, according to Barbeloth's prophecy, the human in need of guidance should be here in no time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960602,
					"content": "Entrance lines... memorized. Entrance effects... confirmed. Hehe, nothing can go wrong this time!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960603,
					"content": "Hey... Why do you guys think the \"final prophecy\" needs Lohen to come here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960604,
					"content": "Oh no, they're here already? Did Durin not finish his lines? Ugh... I need to keep quiet...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960605,
					"content": "Could the final \"might of the dragon\" be talking about Dvalin? He doesn't seem to be here today, though...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960606,
					"content": "Technically speaking, I already saw him when I first returned home from Nod-Krai. He was right beside you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960607,
					"content": "Oh yeah! In Wolvendom, when you were delivering letters for Varka! Wait... So does that mean the prophecy has been fulfilled already?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960608,
					"content": "If we're being generous with our interpretation, then technically, I've already \"thrice faced the might of the dragon.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960609,
					"content": "But do you \"comprehend the true meaning of strength\" yet?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960610,
					"content": "I guess that's why the prophecy has guided me here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960611,
					"content": "Before this place was known as Stormterror's Lair, it was the God of Storms, Decarabian's domain.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960612,
					"content": "But the mighty god who could conjure storms to shut out the world couldn't stem the yearning for freedom within his own walls of wind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960613,
					"content": "Yet the God of the North Wind, with whom he had once vied for the divine throne, found the answer he had always sought only after abandoning his power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960614,
					"content": "Huh? There seems to be more to this kid than Varka led me to believe...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960615,
					"content": "The Mirror of the Dawning Morn, Durin... For a time, they too were lost to confusion and doubt. What led them to strength was more than just power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960616,
					"content": "Well, well... You really seem to be getting it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960617,
					"content": "And Ursa too, the monster who had once been an angel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960618,
					"content": "...Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960619,
					"content": "Paimon thinks you might be on to something here, Lohen... But, uhm, you're speaking kinda funny...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960620,
						700960621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960620,
					"content": "First Durin... now Lohen...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960622,
					"content": "\"The angel who chose power still yearned to remain close to humanity, eventually falling to become a pitiful monster...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960623,
					"content": "\"O humans who have witnessed this all, do you still aspire to power?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960624,
					"content": "Hey! Those are my lines!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960625,
					"content": "Wha—!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960626,
					"content": "Oh dear... The cat's out of the bag now, isn't it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960627,
					"content": "A pleasure to meet you, Lady Nicole. I've read your script, and I have to say, I was very impressed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960628,
					"content": "*sigh*... Why do I get the feeling that Durin dropped his copy?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960629,
					"content": "Oh? So that was part of the prophecy, too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960630,
					"content": "Not at all. If I'd known in advance, I wouldn't have just... *cough*.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960631,
					"content": "Regardless, it was a well-written script. Very entertaining — as a heartwarming little fairy tale, of course. I must say though, I'm not a huge fan of being lectured to... not even by an angel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960632,
					"content": "...I'll choose to believe that was aimed at my former colleague — the one who chose power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960633,
					"content": "Seeing as you've read my script, I suppose you already know everything I have to say?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960634,
					"content": "Indeed, and I'll make sure to treat it as valued advice. Now, was there anything else — or can I get back to compiling my Formidable Foes Fieldbook?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960635,
						700960636
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960635,
					"content": "(He didn't say he plans to follow that advice...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960637
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960637,
					"content": "I must admit though, it's been quite a productive day. I'm sure I must've gotten a tiny bit stronger, at least...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960638,
					"content": "Thank you, everyone... and give my regards to the production crew!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lohen"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960639,
					"content": "*sigh*... Why are humans always so difficult to deal with?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960640,
					"content": "Uhm, can someone tell Paimon what's going on? She's feeling... very, very confused...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960641,
					"content": "Do you remember dealing with Dottore and the poison left behind by Ursa in Mondstadt? I'm told that Lohen also endured his fair share of suffering around that time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960642,
					"content": "Since that was a calamity caused by a former angel, it naturally fell on a current angel to set things right... Though \"things\" didn't go exactly how I planned...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960643
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960643,
					"content": "It seems that humanity's fate is destined to become ever more unpredictable... The guidance of angels is no longer the only thing leading them toward the future.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960644
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960644,
					"content": "But all those infinite possibilities... Perhaps that is precisely where humanity's true strength lies?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960636,
					"content": "(Pretty sure he's just gonna keep compiling his fieldbook, whatever she says...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960637
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960621,
					"content": "Why does everyone sound like they're reading from a script?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960622
					]
				}
			]
		},
